<span class="cs-line hl-p"><span class="cmt"># 1. Scale to larger video data</span></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-p"><span class="cmt">#    SSV2 (220k clips) is small.</span></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-p"><span class="cmt">#    Weaker biases win at scale →</span></span>
