<span class="cs-line"> </span>
<span class="cs-line hl-c"><span class="cmt"># 2. Cross-modality transfer</span></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-c"><span class="cmt">#    No vision-specific components!</span></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-c"><span class="cmt">#    Any modality with temporal</span></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-c"><span class="cmt">#    consistency qualifies:</span></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-c"><span class="cmt">#    audio, proprioception, touch</span></span>
<span class="cs-line"> </span>
<span class="cs-line hl-g"><span class="cmt"># 3. Efficient video encoding</span></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-g"><span class="cmt">#    Standard: O(T × N) per frame</span></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-g"><span class="cmt">#    TDV: O(N) keyframe +</span></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-g"><span class="cmt">#         O(motion) per subsequent</span></span>
<span class="cs-line hl-g"><span class="cmt">#    Analogous to MPEG P-frames</span></span>
<span class="cs-line"> </span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Core thesis: inductive biases</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># are approximately correct.</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Causality is exactly correct.</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Exact assumptions have no ceiling.</span>
      </pre>
    </div>

